text = "[color=#1d2b53]Slash[/color] mooks to reap their [color=#1d2b53]souls[/color] and fill up the [color=#1d2b53]soul bag[/color]. 
[br] [color=purple]Rare[/color] and [color=f3ef7d]legendary[/color] mooks are worth more points. They will run from you! [br]
Follow specific [color=#1d2b53]colour[/color] and [color=#1d2b53]shape[/color] sequences to score [color=#1d2b53]combos[/color] and gain bonus points. [br]
Try to beat the [color=#1d2b53]target score[/color] and make [color=#1d2b53]Death[/color] happy!"
